<!--
    Supplemental Info.plist — merged with the Xcode-generated plist at build time
    (GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE = YES + INFOPLIST_FILE = this file).

    Contains:
      • UTImportedTypeDeclarations  — custom UTIs for formats macOS doesn't know natively
      • CFBundleDocumentTypes       — teaches Launch Services which files to route to us
        (drag-to-icon, Finder "Open With", etc.)

    Formats registered for Finder Open With:
      VFX/Film:   EXR, DPX, Cineon, Radiance HDR, IFF, RLA, Softimage PIC
      Standard:   PNG, JPEG, TIFF (+TX/ENV variants), BMP, GIF, WebP, HEIC/HEIF,
                  PSD, TGA, SGI/RGB, ICO, JPEG-2000, JPEG-XL
      Textures:   DDS, TIFF texture (.tx / .env / .sm / .vsm)
      Float:      PBM/PPM/PGM/PNM, PFM
                  Camera RAW and DNG are not registered. LibRaw is not linked.
      Scientific: FITS, DICOM
-->
